Mr. Kehan Wang is a Co-Founder and serves as Chief Executive Officer and Board Member at Powered Carbon. Mr. Wang has worked in Goldman Sachs and the University of Utah Health in the United States. He has experience in Venture capital investment. He graduated from the University of Utah with a Master of Science in Finance.

